    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "washing potatoes (in a bucket)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "冬の収穫祭では、皆で協力して大量の芋洗いを手伝った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "庭の隅で、子供たちがバケツに入れた芋洗いをしていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「さあ、晩御飯のおかずにするために、芋洗いを始めよう。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "右の番付で大関の、本石町の芋新などは、かまどを五つも並べて間に合わぬ位の注文、土蔵造りの堂々たる構えで芋洗いが二、三人、ひっきりなしに洗っていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "明治世相百話",
                "author": "山本笑月",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "being very crowded",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "週末の駅前は、まるで芋洗いのような混雑ぶりだった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "ライブ会場は、規制が緩くなったせいか、芋洗い状態だった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「電車が遅れてて、乗ったらもう芋洗いだったよ！」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「この店、いつも芋洗いだから、開店と同時に行くのが一番だよ。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
